### Testing ProblemDetails Implementation

# Test valid request
POST http://localhost:5024/api/currency/convert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromCurrency": "USD",
  "toCurrency": "EUR",
  "amount": 100
}

###

# Test invalid request (missing required field)
POST http://localhost:5024/api/currency/convert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromCurrency": "USD",
  "amount": 100
}

###

# Test invalid request (negative amount)
POST http://localhost:5024/api/currency/convert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromCurrency": "USD",
  "toCurrency": "EUR",
  "amount": -100
}

###

# Test unsupported currency
POST http://localhost:5024/api/currency/convert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromCurrency": "XYZ",
  "toCurrency": "EUR",
  "amount": 100
}

###

# Get supported currencies
GET http://localhost:5024/api/currency/supported